10. Containerized Node.js Application

Execution Steps
1.Create Node.js application
2.Write Dockerfile
3.Build Docker image
4.Push image to ECR
5.Create ECS cluster
6.Deploy and test application

Project Overview
Deployed a Node.js application using Docker containers on ECS.

AWS Services Used
Amazon ECR
Amazon ECS
Docker

Features
Container deployment
Scalable hosting
Simplified application management

Architecture
Docker → ECR → ECS
